  "content": {
    "id": "p7-q5-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "For each sequence, write out the first five terms.\nThen describe how each term is obtained from the previous term.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p7-q5-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$a_n=12+n$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$13,14,15,16,17$. Add 1.",
          "worked": "For $n=1,2,3,4,5$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}a_1&=12+1=13\\\\a_2&=12+2=14\\\\a_3&=12+3=15\\\\a_4&=12+4=16\\\\a_5&=12+5=17\\end{aligned}$$\nAdd 1 to the previous term.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$a_n=4+5n$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$9,14,19,24,29$. Add 5.",
          "worked": "For $n=1,2,3,4,5$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}a_1&=4+5(1)=9\\\\a_2&=4+5(2)=14\\\\a_3&=4+5(3)=19\\\\a_4&=4+5(4)=24\\\\a_5&=4+5(5)=29\\end{aligned}$$\nAdd 5 to the previous term.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q5-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$a_n=15-5n$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$10,5,0,-5,-10$. Subtract 5.",
          "worked": "For $n=1,2,3,4,5$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}a_1&=15-5(1)=10\\\\a_2&=15-5(2)=5\\\\a_3&=15-5(3)=0\\\\a_4&=15-5(4)=-5\\\\a_5&=15-5(5)=-10\\end{aligned}$$\nSubtract 5 from the previous term.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q5-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$a_n=3\\times2^n$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$6,12,24,48,96$. Multiply by 2.",
          "worked": "For $n=1,2,3,4,5$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}a_1&=3\\times2^1=6\\\\a_2&=3\\times2^2=12\\\\a_3&=3\\times2^3=24\\\\a_4&=3\\times2^4=48\\\\a_5&=3\\times2^5=96\\end{aligned}$$\nMultiply the previous term by 2.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q5-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$a_n=7\\times(-1)^n$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-7,7,-7,7,-7$. Multiply by $-1$.",
          "worked": "For $n=1,2,3,4,5$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}a_1&=7\\times(-1)^1=-7\\\\a_2&=7\\times(-1)^2=7\\\\a_3&=7\\times(-1)^3=-7\\\\a_4&=7\\times(-1)^4=7\\\\a_5&=7\\times(-1)^5=-7\\end{aligned}$$\nMultiply the previous term by $-1$, so the sign alternates.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q5-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$a_n=80\\times\\left(\\frac12\\right)^n$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$40,20,10,5,2\\frac12$. Divide by 2.",
          "worked": "For $n=1,2,3,4,5$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}a_1&=80\\times\\left(\\frac12\\right)^1=40\\\\a_2&=80\\times\\left(\\frac12\\right)^2=20\\\\a_3&=80\\times\\left(\\frac12\\right)^3=10\\\\a_4&=80\\times\\left(\\frac12\\right)^4=5\\\\a_5&=80\\times\\left(\\frac12\\right)^5=\\frac52\\end{aligned}$$\nDivide the previous term by 2.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      }
    ]
